{"2515280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slap Fighter", "steam_appid": 2515280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/8bd6cec106d67312bc48f3a4b7a340a2.avif?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Slap Fighter VR, the world’s first virtual reality slap fighting game that blends intense combat, mystical martial arts, and a rich, sarcastic storyline. Developed by the indie team at Curious Games, Slap Fighter VR delivers a unique and immersive experience where every slap counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/d356a5cc39595e24934d33c63c2aab2b.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/bfeaaa7cf82fc1db51377df7000359e1.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the power of the elements with each slap. Use fire, water, earth, lightning, and wind to dominate your enemies. Each element offers unique abilities and devastating effects that can turn the tide of any battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/steam_elemental-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1769548816\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/636dd88a385cade5690dc3cd3662593b.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute slow-motion combos that are not only visually stunning but also deliver powerful blows to your opponents. Perfect your timing and become a slap-fighting maestro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/steam_combo-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1769548816\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/eb584e3e0e84d60c9d8d78373a3ba095.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced action with jumps, dodges, and dashes. Navigate the battlefield with agility and precision, making every encounter feel like an epic action scene. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/steam_jump2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1769548816\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/fa4299a5faeb3aa4c6127b513cae941f.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine basic elements to unlock advanced powers. Create devastating combo attacks that will leave your enemies in awe and give you the upper hand in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/63b7ab8bff5d5477119cf94e5ef35d75.avif?t=1769548816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras_big/63b7ab8bff5d5477119cf94e5ef35d75.webp?t=1769548816 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/4b5bc02c2554e916280baffa42000488.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark, dystopian city ruled by the corrupt Slap Syndicate. Play as John, a hero waking from a coma, ready to deliver justice and uncover the secrets of his past under the guidance of the enigmatic Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/master-zoom-mask.gif?t=1769548816\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/b435fa2c4b56bac9516b84118c03c537.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a diverse cast of characters. From the wise and mysterious Master to the fierce FBI Agent and the morally complex Priest, each character adds depth and intrigue to the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/d842d8cecd0e634a0135e07e12726e53.poster.avif?t=1769548816\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/d842d8cecd0e634a0135e07e12726e53.webm?t=1769548816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/8bccf759e545bd122cc05f5e83e54d97.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/c1948f88f6ffd35a9c6bbf99d4f45441.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city gripped by the iron fist of the Slap Syndicate, hope is a rare commodity. You play as John, a man with a mysterious past and a mission to deliver justice one slap at a time. After waking from a coma, you must master the mystical arts of slap fighting under the guidance of the Master. Uncover hidden truths, confront powerful enemies, and navigate a world where every slap reveals a new secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/db41fae925f5f015507a410c1f7a7b52.poster.avif?t=1769548816\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/db41fae925f5f015507a410c1f7a7b52.webm?t=1769548816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/c5a1611e3c8bc9dfbb2621afe811d8ba.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will face formidable foes and uncover the sinister machinations of the Slap Syndicate. Utilize your elemental powers to turn the tide of battle, execute precise combos, and become a legend in the slap-fighting arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/f8689b2d2f8774b8bce82f3c7c36dfff.avif?t=1769548816\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/00b0ecfa48e23e76dd3d3edf5a69a44d.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/97d714cda1b6984a1f3ecec65f10ad5a.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slap Fighter VR, the combat is centered around the unique use of slaps. Forget punches and kicks—here, slaps are your weapon of choice. Each slap can be infused with elemental power, offering a range of strategic options and devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/0cbe7b113e765ef50d8908cd21b9efac.avif?t=1769548816\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/a89402371bcee00ebd2fb711353d8a89.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly detailed world filled with dark humor and intricate secrets. The city’s streets are your battleground, and every corner holds new challenges and opportunities for slap-fueled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/8c11dae1102192915ed63f4b25514c59.avif?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/369aa524f82599994ceb754696a99a6d.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main storyline, Slap Fighter VR offers a variety of side activities that will keep you entertained and engaged. Dive into our arcade-style game, &quot;Slap-a-Mole,&quot; where quick reflexes and precise slaps are the keys to victory. This mini-game is just a taste of the many hidden challenges and surprises waiting to be discovered. Explore the city and uncover secret missions that will test your skills and add layers of fun to your slap-fighting journey. Prepare for endless hours of slap-fueled excitement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/steam_minigames-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1769548816\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/8bd6cec106d67312bc48f3a4b7a340a2.avif?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Slap Fighter VR, the world’s first virtual reality slap fighting game that blends intense combat, mystical martial arts, and a rich, sarcastic storyline. Developed by the indie team at Curious Games, Slap Fighter VR delivers a unique and immersive experience where every slap counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/d356a5cc39595e24934d33c63c2aab2b.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/bfeaaa7cf82fc1db51377df7000359e