aph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/c5a1611e3c8bc9dfbb2621afe811d8ba.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will face formidable foes and uncover the sinister machinations of the Slap Syndicate. Utilize your elemental powers to turn the tide of battle, execute precise combos, and become a legend in the slap-fighting arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/f8689b2d2f8774b8bce82f3c7c36dfff.avif?t=1769548816\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/00b0ecfa48e23e76dd3d3edf5a69a44d.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/97d714cda1b6984a1f3ecec65f10ad5a.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slap Fighter VR, the combat is centered around the unique use of slaps. Forget punches and kicks—here, slaps are your weapon of choice. Each slap can be infused with elemental power, offering a range of strategic options and devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/0cbe7b113e765ef50d8908cd21b9efac.avif?t=1769548816\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/a89402371bcee00ebd2fb711353d8a89.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly detailed world filled with dark humor and intricate secrets. The city’s streets are your battleground, and every corner holds new challenges and opportunities for slap-fueled action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/8c11dae1102192915ed63f4b25514c59.avif?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/369aa524f82599994ceb754696a99a6d.webp?t=1769548816\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main storyline, Slap Fighter VR offers a variety of side activities that will keep you entertained and engaged. Dive into our arcade-style game, &quot;Slap-a-Mole,&quot; where quick reflexes and precise slaps are the keys to victory. This mini-game is just a taste of the many hidden challenges and surprises waiting to be discovered. Explore the city and uncover secret missions that will test your skills and add layers of fun to your slap-fighting journey. Prepare for endless hours of slap-fueled excitement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515280/extras/steam_minigames-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1769548816\" /></span></p>", "short_description": "Step into Slap Fighter, the first VR game of slap fighting! Use elemental powers, execute epic combos, and uncover dark secrets in a dystopian city ruled by the Slap Syndicate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with f